From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NekoBoxForAndroid-podkop <nekobox-podkop@localhost>
Date: Fri, 21 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] nekoutils: add the hooks package used by NekoBox libcore

The libcore of NekoBox for Android sets these hooks so that the sing-box
core can:

* load geoip:/geosite: rule-sets from the databases embedded in the APK
  (GetGeoIPHeadlessRules / GetGeoSiteHeadlessRules);
* notify the app when the user selects an outbound in a selector group
  (Selector_OnProxySelected).

The package is a port of the one in the MatsuriDayo/sing-box fork.

diff --git a/nekoutils/callback.go b/nekoutils/callback.go
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..2e64f1d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/nekoutils/callback.go
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+package nekoutils
+
+var Selector_OnProxySelected func(selectorTag string, tag string)

diff --git a/nekoutils/srs.go b/nekoutils/srs.go
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..2f3e1b9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/nekoutils/srs.go
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+package nekoutils
+
+import "github.com/sagernet/sing-box/option"
+
+var GetGeoIPHeadlessRules func(name string) ([]option.HeadlessRule, error)
+
+var GetGeoSiteHeadlessRules func(name string) ([]option.HeadlessRule, error)
